{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>「天王嫂」方媛自從為郭富城誕下三名千金後，一直將重心放在家庭與照顧女兒身上。前日她突然在社交平台公開一段私人健身訓練片段，大方展示產後最真實體態。</p>\n<h2>方媛公開私人健身訓練片段</h2>\n<p>前日方媛在社交平台分享一段常規健身訓練影片，親自示範如何練出緊緻身體線條以及飽滿臀形。畫面中她穿上黑色運動內衣搭配緊身瑜伽褲，全神貫注地進行各項器械訓練，大方展露平坦腹部與清晰可見馬甲線。即使已經先後經歷三次生育，她全身依然保持零贅肉狀態，完美體態完全看不出已經是三名女兒母親，極致自律表現令大批觀看影片網民感到相當震驚。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765230792339_18968358266afeb614a849e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"4c5W8uyudfs93TFv7FODBh75E5vaVQDH_dZjjv3WY44.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765230792339_18968358266afeb614a849e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>天王嫂親自剖白產後真實心聲</h2>\n<p>針對外界對其極速恢復身形關注，方媛在影片中親自發聲交代狂操肌背後原因。她坦言自從升級成為母親後，絕大部分時間與精力都全數投放在三名愛女及家庭瑣事上。不過她漸漸發覺若果長期將自己需求放在最後一位，整個人狀態反而會變得異常疲憊。因此她下定決心改變現狀，強調無論日常育兒生活有多繁忙，都必須堅持每天擠出時間進行高強度健身訓練，藉此改善產後疲態並重拾活力。</p>\n<h2>郭富城與愛妻組幸福一家五口</h2>\n<p>回顧這段相差22載天王婚姻，郭富城與方媛於2017年正式步入婚姻殿堂，婚後生活一直保持低調且恩愛。兩人先後迎接現年9歲長女郭詠希以及7歲次女郭詠萱誕生，去年再添一名快滿1歲幼女郭詠心，正式組成一家五口熱鬧家庭。近年大女和二女更入讀知名國際學校，單是學費每年便高達40萬港元。為減輕丈夫負擔，女方除了相夫教子外，亦積極經營個人社交平台事業，早前更親自上陣拍攝短片推銷嬰兒用品。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765480776656_8188701856afeb61731ac4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"郭富城 方媛 （圖片來源：Instagram@mokafy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765480776656_8188701856afeb61731ac4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@mokafy）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民激讚方媛產後猶如年輕少女</h2>\n<p>這段健身影片曝光後迅速在網絡引起極大迴響，大批網民湧入留言區熱烈討論其產後狀態。許多人對她誕下三胎後仍能維持少女般體態表示不可思議，紛紛留言驚嘆「為什麼生了三胎還可以身材這麼好啊」、「真的生了三胎嗎？」以及「三胎猶如少女」。部分網民認為她極度自律，直指「生了三個能保持這麼好」、「很自律厲害」；同時亦有人猜測她本身屬於易瘦體質，表示「本身都已經很瘦」、「這就是單純瘦吧」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765569063733_15854013676afeb61835ae8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"e7KEtENnsNXY-zktX_oLKhBkX9X-3MhUiuxUN4rsVDc.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765569063733_15854013676afeb61835ae8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765864122133_5579259096afeb61b0acf6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"rQ6FyOwVW30rhXsX0VJioB75OLGrSOsA39iIOt_YiDo.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507765864122133_5579259096afeb61b0acf6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507766077581004_2066459456afeb61d2e1a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ic-uGokXVqxVcVrGv0pOzujvsiV1xD85a95D5WveQ-U.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179507766077581004_2066459456afeb61d2e1a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:54:31.267226+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1123,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:41:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T08:47:57.235520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:47:57.235520+00:00","content_hash":"deb6d0c5bdc81cc460d8583ff0d4d4f3b198323e52cef983e072802c0714c031","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}